# TEST 25 — Part 7 multiple-passage set (176-200), rebuilt after 동하 judged TEST 23's 191-200 "too short and easy".
# Calibrated on 1000 Vol.4 TEST 10 191-195 (e-mail + e-mail + memo, ~340 words; answers need two texts:
# "next month" from an April 2 e-mail → May, "same charge as the original" → $2,000, "not on a bus line" → not accessible).
# Rules used here: doubles 300-380 words, triples 380-430 words; at least 3 of 5 questions per triple need two texts;
# the deciding clue is indirect (a rule + a date, a cap + a cost, a schedule + a request), and wrong options reuse
# names, numbers and dates that really appear in the texts.
